<section class="card" aria-labelledby="test-expired">
  <h2 id="test-expired">Not taken</h2>
  <% if test.attempt %>
    <p>The technical test ended <%= l(test.due_at.in_time_zone, format: :long_wib) %> and we received no answer.</p>
  <% else %>
    <p>The deadline to start the technical test was <%= l(test.start_by.in_time_zone, format: :long_wib) %> and the test was not started.</p>
  <% end %>
  <p class="small">The technical test stage is recorded as not taken. The result of CV screening and technical test appears on the status page once this stage is complete.</p>
</section>
